      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bienvenid<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa al Café Rubor, para los que quieren\nsocializar... pero desde la distancia.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Puaj!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005000750061006A00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Este café está salado! ¡Qué asco!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10045007300740065002000630061006600E9002000650073007400E1002000730061006C00610064006F0021002000A10051007500E90020006100730063006F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Cómo? Si precisamente nuestro mezcla Rubor\nes famoso por su suavidad y su dulce aroma.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tendría que ser de todo menos salado.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540065006E0064007200ED00610020007100750065002000730065007200200064006500200074006F0064006F0020006D0065006E006F0073002000730061006C00610064006F002E00100002011401C00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Naaa!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004E00610061006100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Un Nacli! ¡El Pokémon Halita!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10055006E0020004E00610063006C00690021002000A10045006C00200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002000480061006C006900740061002100100002011401C00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tú eres un<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀa Entrenador<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀa, ¿verdad? ¡Ayúdame!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400FA0020006500720065007300200075006E00100003110000FF0100006100200045006E007400720065006E00610064006F007200100003110000FF01000061002C002000BF007600650072006400610064003F002000A10041007900FA00640061006D0065002100100002011401C00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Atrapa a ese Nacli, por favor. ¡Seguro que ha sido\nel causante de que el café esté salado de repente!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 106
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Por favor, atrapa a ese Nacli!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10050006F00720020006600610076006F0072002C00200061007400720061007000610020006100200065007300650020004E00610063006C0069002100100002011401C00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Puaj, esto no hay quien se lo beba.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005000750061006A002C0020006500730074006F0020006E006F002000680061007900200071007500690065006E0020007300650020006C006F00200062006500620061002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Es el Nacli que te han pedido capturar.\n¿Quieres iniciar un combate para atraparlo?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Adelante!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004100640065006C0061006E0074006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ahora no",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410068006F007200610020006E006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Naaa!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004E00610061006100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Atrapa a ese Nacli, por favor. ¡Seguro que ha sido\nel causante de que el café esté salado de repente!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 106
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Qué ascazo! ¡Esto es imbebible!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10051007500E900200061007300630061007A006F0021002000A1004500730074006F00200065007300200069006D00620065006200690062006C006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No has logrado atrapar al Nacli...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F00200068006100730020006C006F0067007200610064006F0020006100740072006100700061007200200061006C0020004E00610063006C0069002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Has atrapado al Nacli!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100480061007300200061007400720061007000610064006F00200061006C0020004E00610063006C006900210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Has conseguido atraparlo? Tráelo a la cafetería,\npor favor.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF00480061007300200063006F006E007300650067007500690064006F00200061007400720061007000610072006C006F003F00200054007200E10065006C006F002000610020006C00610020006300610066006500740065007200ED0061002C000A0070006F00720020006600610076006F0072002E00100002011401C00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Señorita, aquí tiene al responsable de que su\ncafé estuviera salado.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 2348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006500F1006F0072006900740061002C002000610071007500ED0020007400690065006E006500200061006C00200072006500730070006F006E007300610062006C00650020006400650020007100750065002000730075000A00630061006600E90020006500730074007500760069006500720061002000730061006C00610064006F002E00100002011401C00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Es un Pokémon llamado Nacli, cuyo cuerpo está\nformado por halita o sal de roca. Al desplazarse,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ndesprende cristales de sal.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 2496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 131
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Permítame que le sirva un café como es debido.\nSin coste alguno, por supuesto.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 2760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No se moleste. Al principio choca un poco, pero\nluego el paladar se acostumbra...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¡En realidad, creo que lo prefiero así! ¡Sí, ahora\nsoy fan del café salado!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 2928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 161
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A fin de cuentas, ¿no hay sitios que sirven café\ncon caramelo a la sal y cosas así?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tendrían que añadirlo a la carta. Yo creo que\nsería todo un éxito.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540065006E0064007200ED0061006E00200071007500650020006100F10061006400690072006C006F002000610020006C0061002000630061007200740061002E00200059006F0020006300720065006F0020007100750065000A00730065007200ED006100200074006F0064006F00200075006E002000E9007800690074006F002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡¿Eeeh?! Eh... sí, claro. El cliente siempre tiene la\nrazón. Tendremos en cuenta su sugerencia.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un café suave y aromático con notas de sal de\nNacli...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 3756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006E002000630061006600E900200073007500610076006500200079002000610072006F006D00E1007400690063006F00200063006F006E0020006E006F007400610073002000640065002000730061006C002000640065000A004E00610063006C0069002E002E002E00100002011401C00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "He intentado dar con la fórmula perfecta, pero\nlos clientes siguen encontrándolo salado.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nBueno, lo quitaré de la carta, pero lo mantendré\npara la clientela selecta.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 3876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 172
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Al fin y al cabo, sobre gustos no hay nada escrito.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C002000660069006E0020007900200061006C0020006300610062006F002C00200073006F00620072006500200067007500730074006F00730020006E006F00200068006100790020006E0061006400610020006500730063007200690074006F002E00100002011401C00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En todo caso, me alegro de haber descubierto el\nmotivo de tanto café salado. Gracias.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿$",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00240000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sobre gustos no hay nada escrito, pero seguiré\nintentando dar con la mezcla perfecta universal.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
